<title>JAPAN: Yasuda Trust 96/97 problem loan disposals Y300 bln.</title>
<headline>Yasuda Trust 96/97 problem loan disposals Y300 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yasuda Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said on Friday it disposed of about 300 billion yen in problem loans in the 1996/97 financial year, ended March 31.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the disposals included provisions for expected losses on loans it provided to three failed financial firms affiliated with Nippon Credit Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>It also said appraisal losses on its securities holdings were estimated at 126 billion yen in 1996/97.</p>
<p>The bank is scheduled to announce its 1996/97 business results in late May.</p>
</text>
